Remember when building the examples to specify directory of installation
of sps2 library.
Supposing that your sps2 installation directory is /Develop/sps2dev-0.3.0a
make should be invoked in this way

make SPS2DIR=/Develop/sps2dev-0.3.0a

If sps2 is not correctly specified and sps2 header are not reachable in 
standard include directory, examples will not compile.